    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "なに。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空、本当に夜空のことを大事にしてるな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……知ってる。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そっか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "知ってるから、苦しい時もある。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "でも、今日はその話じゃない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――二人は、店長のマンション方面へ歩き出す。\n夜空はいつものように半歩離れて歩く。\nけれど、以前のように逃げるような距離ではなかった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――店長マンション前の帰り道――",
      "bg": "images/assets/bg/bg_manager_mansion_road_night.png",
      "bgMode": "forceReplace",
      "forceBackgroundReplace": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日は、こっちでいいのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長の帰り道でしょ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "夜空の帰り道ではないな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "少し歩く。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "目的地は？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……ない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "前にも聞いたな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日は、一人になりたいわけじゃない？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "答えなくていい。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "そういうところ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "悪くない。\nでも、ずるい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日もか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――街灯の下で、夜空が立ち止まる。\n店長も少し離れて足を止めた。\n風は冷たいが、以前より少しだけ穏やかだった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "店長。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ん？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "この前のこと。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
